    4     80        14      80.000        24    40.000.000
    5    160        15     160.000        25    50.000.000
    6    320        16     320.000        26    60.000.000
    7    640        17     640.000        27    70.000.000
    8   1280        18   1.280.000        28    80.000.000
    9   2560        19   2.560.000        29    90.000.000
   10   5120        20   5.120.000       30+   100.000.000

Note that it is almost impossible to gain levels above level 20 without
using some other method than just killing monsters. Here, you almost
certainly will have to eat wraiths, quaff potions of gain level, or
resort to other methods of gaining a level.


